 BEGAN ON SEPTEMBER 16, 2010.  OWNERS MAY CONTACT GARMIN DIRECTLY AT 1-866-957-1981 OR NISSAN AT 1-800-647-7261.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false}]}
